{
  "id": "LUK.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 7",
  "verseCount": 50,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yahonia omukhalabani womukendurioni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa yali namaliile amakhuwake mumarwi kabandu, yeenjila muKaperinaumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omusumba womuseesia undi, owa yaheela muno, yalwala, niyeenya okhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yahulila khukaYesu, yaruma abakofu abomubaYahudi, okhumusaaya mbu yeetse amuhonie omusumbawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo olwa boola ewa Yesu yali bamusaaya muno, nibasunga bari Akwanile mbu omukholele orio; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba aheelanga lihanga lieefwe, khandi omwene yakhuumbashila isinagogi yeefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yesu natsia ninabo. Ne olwa yali nali ahambi nende inzu, omuseesia yaruma abeetsa bandi, namusunjila mbu Omwami, oranyakhana ta; okhuba isie shingwanile mbu witse winjile hasi weshilama shieinzu yanje ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khulwako kata shinduutsi mbu engwanile okhukhwitsila iwe ta; ne sunga likhuwa mana omusumba wanje alahona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila nasi siesi endi omundu owareebwa hasi wobutuchi, nasi endi nende abasikari abali hasi wanje; nimusunjila mulala mbu Tsia, naye atsiitsanga; noundi, mbu Yitsa, naye yeetsanga; kata nende omusumba wanje, mbu Khola lino, nalikholanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Yesu yahulila amakhuwa ako, yachenya, nashiukhana naboolela abemikanda abali nibalondananga ninaye ari Emusunjila mbu eshili okhulolakhwo obusuubili obukhongo shinga buno tawe, kata muIsiraeli ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabarume abo olwa bakalukha mgo, banyoola omusumba oyo nali omulamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yalamusilia omwana womukhasi omulekhwa eNaini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyumakhwo yatsia khwitaala elilangwa mbu Naini; abeechibe nibatsia ninaye, halala nende omukanda omukhongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yoola ahambi khushilibwa shielitaala, lola, omufu undi yachingwa narusibwamwo; yali omwana omuteelwa wanyina, naye nomukhasi omulekhwa; khandi abandu abanji abomwitaala bali nibali ninaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Omwami yamulola yamutiililwa eshisa, namusunjila ari Oralila ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nasita ahambi natiilakhwo khushitalatalilo, abashichinga nibeema. Naboola mbu Omusooliili iwe, ekhubiila mbu buukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noyo owali nafwile niyeekhala, nachaaka okhuboola. Namuhaana khunyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana oburii nibubahamba bosi; nibamuheelesia Nyasaye oluyali, nibasunga bari Omunabii omukhongo wabuushile mwifwe; khandi bari Nyasaye yabacheniihe abandube. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuma yino niyitswana khuye mubuYahudi mwosi, nende mumbali tsiosi tsiebweneyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abarume abarula khuYohana Omubatisii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeechi baYohana nibamuboolela akamakhuwa ako kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yohana nalanga babili abokhubeechibe, nabaruma ewOmwami, nareeba mbu Iwe niwe omwenoyo owitsa, nohomba khulindiilile oundi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo olwa bali niboolile ewa yali, basunga bari Yohana Omubatisii akhurumile khwiwe, ari Iwe niwe omwenoyo owitsa, nohomba khulindiilile oundi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushise shieneshio yahonia abanji abobulwale, nende abanyakhananga mumibili chiabwe, nende ababaroho ababii; kata abanji abali ababofu, yabanyalila okhulola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nakalusia nababoolela mbu Mulatsie mumuboolele Yohana amakhuwa aka muhuliile nende aka muluutsi; mbu ababofu banyalilungwa okhulola, abetsindieku bachendanga, abobuchele basiiylmgwa, abeekala amarwi bahulilanga, abafu balamusibungwa, abamanani nabo beelwatsilungwa Amakhuwa Amalayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne noweikhabi omundu yesi oureesichirasibwa khwisie ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarume baYohana olwa bali nibeenyooshe, yachaaka okhusunjila abemikanda khukaYohana, ari Nishiina eshia mwarula nimutsia mushitsiimi okhulola? Mbu olusi olureesibwa nomuyeka noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nishiina eshia mwarula nimutsia okhulola? Mbu omundu owifwalile tsingubo tsindorotoro? Mbula, abeefwala tsingubo tsioluyali nibamenya eshiami, babeetsanga mumataala kabaruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nishiina eshia mwarula nimutsia okhulola? Mbu omunabii? Ee, khandi emuboolela mbu noushila omunabii muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uno nomwenoyo owa kahandiichilwakhwo mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu bosi, kata nende abasololi bobushuru, olwa bakahulila, bafuchiilila obulunjishi bwaNyasaye, okhuba bali nibabatisibwa obubatisii bwaYohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula abaFarisayo nende abakhulundu bamalako, abeene bakhaya khubwabwe obwibaali bwaNyasaye, okhuba shibali nibabatisibwa ninaye ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nenjelasie abandu abolwibulo luno nende shiina? Kata bafwana barie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafwana shinga abaana abeekhaale haluyia, nibalanjilisania, nibasunga bari Khumuupiile lilele, nimurashina ta; khwikhuulile, nimuralila ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila Yohana Omubatisii yayeetsile naraliitsanga ebiliibwa kata okhunywa idivai ta, nimuboola muri Ali nende lidimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana wOmundu naye yeetsile naliitsanga nende okhunywa, nimuboola muri Lole, nomulangu khandi omumeesi, omwitsa wabasololi bobushuru nende aboonooni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obuchesi bumanyikhanga shinga olwa buli habwene khulwa abaana babwo bosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yali ebunango waSimoni omuFarisayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala khubaFarisayo naye yamulanga mbu alie ewuwe. Kho niyeenjila munzu yomuFarisayo oyo, niyeekhala habiliibwa okhulia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana lola, ngwoyo omukhasi undi owomwitaala elo, omwonooni; ne olwa yamanya shinga olwa yeekhaale naliitsanga munzu yomuFarisayo tsana yatsiayo nende ichupa yamafura, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nasinjila emukongowe, habilenje, nalilanga amasika, nachaaka okhunyisia ebilenjebie namasikake, nabieya nende liswi eliokhumurwekwe, natsur zuuna ebilenjebie, nabitsushiilila amafura ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa omuFarisayo owamulanga yalola, yasunga mumwoyokwe ari Omundu uno naba nali omunabii, yakhamanyile omukhasi uno oumutiilangakhwo shinga olwa ali, kata imelaye, mbu nomwonooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yesu nakalusia, namusunjila mbu Simoni, liliho likhuwa elia enzenya okhukhusunjila. Naye ari, Khaboole, omwechesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ari, Omuhosii undi wamapeesa yali nende abeekobibe babili; mulala yali niyahola tsitinari ebikhumi biraano, oundi amakhumi karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibabula nende eshia barunga, yabaleshela bombi. Oulashila okhumuheela khubo ali heena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni nakalusia ari Isie ndakhapaara mbu omwenoyo owa yaleshela ebinji. Namusunjila ari Opaarile habwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nashiukhana ewa omukhasi tsana yali, namusuniila Simoni ari Olola omukhasi uno? Enzinjiile munzuwo, nawe norambeelesia amatsi khulwa ebiienje bianje ta; ne ye anyisiye ebilenje bianje namasikake, nabieya neliswilie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiunzunzuunilekhwo ta; ne ye, okhurula olwa enzinjiile muno, shialeshile okhutsunzuuna ebilenje bianje ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurwe kwanje shiotsushiiliilekhwo amafura ta; ne ye atsushiiliile ebilenje bianje amafura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila nikhusunjila mbu ebionoonobie, ebili ebinji, abilesheelwe; okhuba ali nobuheeli obunji; ne ouleshelwa ebituutu, abeetsanga nobuheeli obutuutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namusunjila omukhasi oyo ari Wakhamala okhuleshelwa ebionoonobio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne aba yeekhala ninabo habiliibwa bachaaka okhusunga mumioyo chiabwe, bari Niwina uno, kata ouleshelanga ebionoono? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namusunjila omukhasi oyo ari Obusuubilibwo bukhuhoniye; otsie nomulembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
